# <type>(<scope>): <outcome>
#
# Explain what changed and why. Keep one concern per commit.
#
# type:    feat | fix | refactor | docs | test | chore | perf | ci
# scope:   package or area (daemon, engine, ui, cli, docs, infrastructure, ...);
#          omit it for cross-cutting changes.
# subject: present tense, lower case, no trailing period.
#
# Example: fix(daemon): a failed socket accept no longer stops the daemon
#
# A behavior change also adds a CHANGELOG.md entry.
